{"id":"facilement","lemma":"facilement","pos":"adv","rank":1355,"glosses":["easily"],"ipa":"/fa.sil.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/19/Fr-facilement.ogg/Fr-facilement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Le bois brûle facilement.","en":"Wood burns easily.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34552","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"wood"},{"g":"to burn","l":"brûler"},null]},{"text":"Le verre casse facilement.","en":"Glass breaks easily.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2480","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"glass"},{"g":"to break","l":"casser"},null]},{"text":"Je pleure facilement.","en":"I cry easily.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to cry, to weep","l":"pleurer"},null]},{"text":"Vous pouvez facilement trouver la banque.","en":"You can easily find the bank.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},null,{"g":"to find"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bank"}]},{"text":"Je pourrais réparer ça facilement.","en":"I could fix that easily.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to repair, fix, mend"},{"g":"that"},null]}]}